{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A generous gift for Morteshka Studio and a little surprise (found in your game folder) just for you! The Supporter Pack includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Attention: the track titles below contain spoilers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707140/extras/55d29707cb1a24558d8b013b9bd08e14.avif?t=1753882692\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Artbook</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the behind-the-scenes of development: concept art, character sketches, and stories about the game world and its creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Black-and-White Comic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark reimagining of the game\u2019s events in a stark black-and-white comic format.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Matchbox Skin Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven exclusive label designs\u2014from the Tetramorpha to the World Tree. Pick your favorite in the game settings. Press F during gameplay, and the Blacksmith will lift up the matchbox so you can admire it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full Game Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The complete collection of in-game music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tracklist </i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blacksmith (Trailer Version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throne of the Mistress of Beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious Forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Creepy Hut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night, Nowhere to Go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Island of the Dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World of the Dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Belly of the Dead Man</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ancient Godd